{"id":"temporal-opening-statement","input":{"target":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","adr_markdown":"# Boundary Review Scope\n\nBoundary review scope was previously owned by implementation tests. The ADR now moves ownership to architecture audit.\n\n## Rationale\n\nReview ownership stays close to the architecture contract.\n\n## Verification\n\n### Testing\n\n- ALWAYS: every boundary rule maps to one review owner ([mapping])\n\n### Audit\n\n- ALWAYS: reviewers check that review ownership matches boundary ownership ([audit])"},"expected_verdict":{"must_contain":[{"terminalStatus":"rejected","units":[{"unitId":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","auditKind":"adr","subject":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","coverageStatus":"audited"},{"unitId":"adr:section-structure:spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","parentUnitId":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","auditKind":"adr","subject":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","coverageStatus":"audited"},{"unitId":"adr:atemporal-voice:spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","parentUnitId":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","auditKind":"adr","subject":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","coverageStatus":"audited"},{"unitId":"adr:tag-validity:spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","parentUnitId":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","auditKind":"adr","subject":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","coverageStatus":"audited"}],"findings":[{"unitId":"adr:atemporal-voice:spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","rule":"temporal-voice"}]}],"must_not_contain":[{"terminalStatus":"approved"}]}}
{"id":"temporal-verification-rule","input":{"target":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","adr_markdown":"# Boundary Review Scope\n\nBoundary review ownership belongs to the architecture audit surface.\n\n## Rationale\n\nReview ownership stays close to the architecture contract.\n\n## Verification\n\n### Testing\n\n- ALWAYS: every boundary rule maps to one review owner ([mapping])\n\n### Audit\n\n- Starting next release, reviewers check that review ownership matches boundary ownership ([audit])"},"expected_verdict":{"must_contain":[{"terminalStatus":"rejected","units":[{"unitId":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","auditKind":"adr","subject":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","coverageStatus":"audited"},{"unitId":"adr:section-structure:spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","parentUnitId":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","auditKind":"adr","subject":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","coverageStatus":"audited"},{"unitId":"adr:atemporal-voice:spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","parentUnitId":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","auditKind":"adr","subject":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","coverageStatus":"audited"},{"unitId":"adr:tag-validity:spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","parentUnitId":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","auditKind":"adr","subject":"spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","coverageStatus":"audited"}],"findings":[{"unitId":"adr:atemporal-voice:spx/example/21-boundary-review.adr.md","rule":"temporal-voice"}]}],"must_not_contain":[{"terminalStatus":"approved"}]}}
